✔ one-click novel creation adapts, saves, extracts and builds the selected episode before onDone (0.5186ms)
✔ retry after extraction failure keeps the prepared screenplay and never adapts the same source twice (0.8817ms)
✔ structured input skips adaptation and a malformed adaptation cannot trigger extraction or completion (0.4545ms)
