✔ asset generation displays queued count, outcomes and actionable failures in both languages (5.3252ms)
✔ the P4 contrast preview matches the server rule: two of the last five held one line and this focus opposes it (0.3901ms)
✔ the one primary button follows what the workspace shows (3.2279ms)
✔ confirming the build makes the server hold the text first, then runs the three requests, and never sends the script itself (0.7328ms)
✔ a build stops before sending anything when the server could not take the text (3.3168ms)
✔ disposing a build between extraction and storyboard never sends the next mutation or navigates (0.5696ms)
